      <item row="5" column="1">
       <widget class="QLabel" name="maxLengthModifierLabel">
        <property name="toolTip">
         <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Read at most N units. Strings stop earlier at and consume their NUL terminator. For byte and string fields N counts bytes; for integer fields N counts elements.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Example:&lt;br/&gt;asciistr&amp;lt;max:32&amp;gt; someString;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
        </property>
        <property name="text">
         <string>&lt;max:N&gt;</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
