      <item row="6" column="1">
       <widget class="QLabel" name="variableDirectiveLabel">
        <property name="toolTip">
         <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bind a scalar integer field to NAME. Reference it later as $NAME, or through a nested member path such as $header.itemCount.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Example:&lt;br/&gt;/var(itemCount) uint8 count;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
        </property>
        <property name="text">
         <string>/var(NAME)</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
      <item row="5" column="0">
       <widget class="QLabel" name="byteTypeLabel">
        <property name="toolTip">
         <string>One binary byte. With &lt;len:N&gt;, read N bytes.</string>
        </property>
        <property name="text">
         <string>byte</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
      <item row="5" column="2">
       <widget class="QLabel" name="fixedLengthModifierLabel">
        <property name="toolTip">
         <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Read exactly N units. For byte and string fields N counts bytes; for integer fields N counts elements. N may reference a bound variable. NUL bytes are content in fixed-length strings.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Examples:&lt;br/&gt;byte&amp;lt;len:$payloadLength&amp;gt; payload;&lt;br/&gt;int16&amp;lt;len:2&amp;gt; values;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
        </property>
        <property name="text">
         <string>&lt;len:N&gt;</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
      <item row="6" column="2">
       <widget class="QLabel" name="repeatDirectiveLabel">
        <property name="toolTip">
         <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Decode the following field or struct N times. N may be an integer or a bound variable path.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Example:&lt;br/&gt;struct Header { /var(itemCount) uint8 count; }&lt;br/&gt;struct File { Header head; /repeat($head.itemCount) FileItem; }&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
        </property>
        <property name="text">
         <string>/repeat(N)</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
      <item row="6" column="0">
       <widget class="QLabel" name="untilExpressionModifierLabel">
        <property name="toolTip">
         <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Read bytes or typed elements until =, &amp;lt;, or &amp;gt; matches. The matching element or string sentinel is not consumed, so the next field starts at it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Example:&lt;br/&gt;byte&amp;lt;until:=&amp;quot;END&amp;quot;&amp;gt; prefix;&lt;br/&gt;asciistr marker;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
        </property>
        <property name="text">
         <string>&lt;until:expr&gt;</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
      <item row="7" column="0">
       <widget class="QLabel" name="conditionDirectiveLabel">
        <property name="toolTip">
         <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Validate the following scalar field. If the comparison fails, mark the containing struct invalid and stop it after the failing field.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Operators: =, &amp;lt;, &amp;gt;&lt;br/&gt;Values: quoted string, decimal, hexadecimal, or $variable&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Example: /cond(=0x2450) uint16 magic;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
        </property>
        <property name="text">
         <string>/cond(expr)</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
      <item row="7" column="1">
       <widget class="QLabel" name="whenDirectiveLabel">
        <property name="toolTip">
         <string>Decode a field only when a two-sided integer comparison is true. A false /when consumes no bytes and emits no row.</string>
        </property>
        <property name="text">
         <string>/when(expr)</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
      <item row="7" column="2">
       <widget class="QLabel" name="assertDirectiveLabel">
        <property name="toolTip">
         <string>Validate a struct after decoding prior members without consuming bytes.</string>
        </property>
        <property name="text">
         <string>/assert(expr)</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
      <item row="8" column="0">
       <widget class="QLabel" name="bitfieldBlockLabel">
        <property name="toolTip">
         <string>Add display-only bit or bits children under a scalar integer field.</string>
        </property>
        <property name="text">
         <string>bitfields</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
      <item row="8" column="1">
       <widget class="QLabel" name="defaultDirectiveLabel">
        <property name="toolTip">
         <string>Select the named top-level entry by default for previews. This file-level directive may appear once.</string>
        </property>
        <property name="text">
         <string>/default NAME</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
